# A swipe to reply (LLP 1057.001): past the knee the row's `swiperight`
# runs while its hold owns the row, then it springs home; short of the
# knee it springs home and nothing runs; a vertical move is not a swipe.
tap toggle-windowed
tap history-100
drag reply-hit-m-000001 150 0 250
drag reply-hit-m-000002 30 0 300
drag reply-hit-m-000003 4 60 200
